# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from data/forever and tools/lib/professions/gathering. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/mining-blacksmithing
title Mining + Blacksmithing 1-300
category Professions
kind profession
skills Mining, Blacksmithing
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Mining and Blacksmithing 1-300 together, for both factions: each Blacksmithing stretch starts with
# a Mining step in the areas that give what that stretch needs, which also raises Mining, and the
# craft follows with the materials in your bags. Spares carry to the next stretch, and when a
# stretch needs what Mining cannot gather yet, Mining catches up first. Mining ranks are trained at
# the Blacksmithing trainer visit when the skill allows. Mining reaches 300 before the last
# Blacksmithing stretch.
#
# The Mining areas are the Mining guide's (the most nodes up at a safe level, listed for your
# level); the Blacksmithing route, its recipes, trainers, vendor goods and counts the Blacksmithing
# guide's (enough for 9 players in 10). Anything Mining does not give is bought or farmed as there
# (Gather, Buy or Mix).
#
# ASSUMED: how far Mining rises on a stretch's materials is the Mining guide's expected skill-ups
# per node in the band's areas and what players' recorded gathers gave per node, averaged over the
# band's areas.
# About 75 hours of mining in 15 gathering stretches (the other way through the fork: about 242
# hours); it gathers about 560 Mithril Ore, 540 Solid Stone, 380 Copper Ore, 320 Iron Ore, 280 Rough
# Stone and 260 Tin Ore.
#
# Blacksmithing hammers bars into plate, mail and weapons, and makes the sharpening and grinding
# stones later plans use. Mining is its partner: the bars are smelted from ore and the stones come
# from the veins.
#
# Ranks: Apprentice at any level from any Blacksmithing trainer; Journeyman from level 10 at the
# city trainers (the first trainer teaches recipes only up to 50); Expert from level 20 (50s) at
# Bengus Deepforge or Saru Steelfury; Artisan from level 35 at Brikk Keencraft in Booty Bay, for
# both factions.
#
# Specialisation (optional, not needed for 300) opens at 200 and level 40: Armorsmith or
# Weaponsmith.
#
# The route (crafts are about what it takes; yellow and green recipes can take a few more):
# Apprentice (1-75), from level 1:
#    1-25  30 Rough Sharpening Stone: 30 Rough Stone
#   25-75  84 Rough Grinding Stone: 168 Rough Stone
# Journeyman (75-140), from level 10:
#   75-84  60 Coarse Grinding Stone: 120 Coarse Stone
#   84-95  11 Rough Bronze Leggings: 66 Bronze Bar
#   95-100 5 Patterned Bronze Bracers: 25 Bronze Bar, 10 Coarse Grinding Stone
#  100-115 30 Heavy Grinding Stone: 90 Heavy Stone
#  115-125 10 Patterned Bronze Bracers: 50 Bronze Bar, 20 Coarse Grinding Stone
#  125-140 15 Silvered Bronze Gauntlets: 120 Bronze Bar, 15 Silver Bar, 30 Coarse Grinding Stone
# Expert (140-210), from level 20:
#  140-175 40 Green Iron Bracers: 40 Green Dye, 240 Iron Bar
#  175-180 8 Solid Grinding Stone: 32 Solid Stone
#  180-185 28 Solid Sharpening Stone: 28 Solid Stone
#  185-195 15 Golden Scale Bracers: 30 Heavy Grinding Stone, 75 Steel Bar
#  195-210 17 Mithril Plate Pants: 204 Mithril Bar
# Artisan (210-300), from level 35:
#   with Plans: Mithril Spurs:
#    make 37 Solid Grinding Stone: 148 Solid Stone
#    210-225 15 Mithril Spurs: 60 Mithril Bar, 45 Solid Grinding Stone
#    225-235 16 Dense Sharpening Stone: 16 Dense Stone
#    make 84 Solid Grinding Stone: 336 Solid Stone
#    235-245 28 Mithril Spurs: 112 Mithril Bar, 84 Solid Grinding Stone
#   Heavy Mithril (no plans):
#    210-215 6 Heavy Mithril Axe: 72 Mithril Bar, 12 Citrine, 24 Heavy Leather, 6 Solid Grinding Stone
#    215-225 10 Mithril Coif: 100 Mithril Bar, 60 Mageweave Cloth
#    225-235 16 Dense Sharpening Stone: 16 Dense Stone
#    235-240 11 Heavy Mithril Boots: 154 Mithril Bar, 44 Thick Leather
#    240-245 5 Imperial Plate Belt: 5 Aquamarine, 30 Rugged Leather, 110 Thorium Bar
#  245-270 27 Imperial Plate Bracers: 27 Star Ruby, 540 Thorium Bar
#   with Plans: Radiant Boots and Plans: Radiant Leggings:
#    270-290 22 Radiant Boots: 88 Heart of Fire, 308 Thorium Bar
#    290-300 10 Radiant Leggings: 40 Heart of Fire, 200 Thorium Bar
#   with Plans: Radiant Boots:
#    270-290 22 Radiant Boots: 88 Heart of Fire, 308 Thorium Bar
#    290-300 10 Imperial Plate Leggings: 20 Star Ruby, 440 Thorium Bar
#   with Plans: Thorium Leggings:
#    270-275 11 Imperial Plate Bracers: 11 Star Ruby, 220 Thorium Bar
#    275-300 27 Thorium Leggings: 108 Red Power Crystal, 702 Thorium Bar
#   Imperial Plate (no plans):
#    270-290 20 Imperial Plate Boots: 20 Aquamarine, 20 Star Ruby, 680 Thorium Bar
#    290-300 10 Imperial Plate Leggings: 20 Star Ruby, 440 Thorium Bar

section Blacksmithing 1-75

step Learn Blacksmithing
  tip No character level needed.
  train Blacksmithing Apprentice

step Buy a Blacksmith Hammer
  tip A tool: it stays in your bags, and most recipes need it.
  buy 5956 x1 nearest

step Learn Mining
  tip No character level needed.
  train Mining Apprentice

step Buy a Mining Pick
  tip A tool: it stays in your bags, and mining needs it.
  buy 2901 x1 nearest

step Mine until Mining 50
  tip This area gives the Rough Stone to Mining 50; the next one the rest.
